# Wave W17-N (Route 110): under sand — the walking road’s pale sand, even and well-kept under the humming cycleway (design-authorised: a clear connected path of pale sand running end to end, Fairhaven to Lilac). A touch greyer than the first road’s fresh sand — pillar shade lives on this road.
